      "name": "Easy Keto Jello Recipe [Only 3 Ingredients]",
      "description": "Satisfy your sweet cravings effortlessly with this Easy 3-Ingredient Keto Jello—a refreshing, sugar-free treat that’s both fun and family-friendly. Made with just unflavored gelatin, hot and cold water, and your favorite sugar-free drink mix, this homemade jello delivers the classic wobbly texture without any of the carbs. It’s a quick, customizable dessert that fits seamlessly into a low-carb or ketogenic lifestyle, offering just about zero net carbs per serving. Perfect for make-ahead snacking or a light after-dinner indulgence, this jello sets beautifully in the fridge and can be tailored to any flavor you love—from berry to citrus and beyond. Whether you’re prepping for a holiday or simply want a nostalgic, guilt-free treat, this keto jello is as easy to make as it is to enjoy.\n\nMake sure to double-check the ingredient list on the sugar-free drink mix you are using. Try to find one using stevia, if possible, as it will have fewer carbs. Popular brands like Crystal Light will use maltodextrin, which does have some added carbs. SweetLeaf, Stur, Spruce, and many other brands will have lower carbs compared to Crystal Light. Though you can use pretty much any as long as it fits within your macros – the carb counts should still be quite low.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n1 cup water, cold\n3-4 tablespoon gelatin powder\n1 cup water, hot\n1-2 tablespoon sugar free drink mix powder\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 2 servings of Easy 3-Ingredient Keto Jello. Each serving comes out to be 37 calories, 0g fats, 0.1g net carbs, and 9g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
